The prover exposed a K frontend issue around a zero-separator statement list containing both a docstring expression and a return. The docstring is not part of the required signature or behavior, so I’m removing it from `solution.py`; the executable target then has a single statement and avoids that parser/prover artifact without weakening the computation being proved.
