All three proof obligations now close together: arithmetic inverse for every lowercase code, the continuation-parametric comprehension invariant for arbitrary-length strings, and end-to-end execution of the exact translated module against the independent decoder specification. I’m packaging the exact successful compile/run/prove sequence and doing a clean rerun.
